{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034530/extras/zBFHdle_-_Imgur.png?t=1749476231\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034530/extras/IngLegacy.png?t=1749476231\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Zilar: Empire of the Underground revolves around the story of a magical book within the game and invites you on a unique adventure.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>The hero of our story, Zemandev, embarks on a perilous journey to reclaim the magical crown inherited from his ancestor, the Grand Master Zonaran. This mystical crown has been seized by the Yeclers and their leader, Zilar, who were once thought to exist only in legends. To prevent the devastating wars between humans and Yeclers from reigniting and to reclaim his lost legacy, Zemandev ventures into Zilar\u2019s underground empire.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>On this journey, you must overcome the obstacles set by Zilar and the Yeclers, uncover the dark secrets of the past, and fight to reclaim your inheritance. Your courage and wit will be the keys to this epic quest.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034530/extras/SailGif.gif?t=1749476231\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034530/extras/IngModes.png?t=1749476231\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Engage in relentless battles with the Yeclers and develop strategies to defeat your enemies. Utilize the two distinct modes of your weapon to adapt your tactics to any situation and turn the battlefield to your advantage.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034530/extras/GifSword.gif?t=1749476231\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034530/extras/IngSurvive.png?t=1749476231\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>While escaping from Zilar, test your speed and agility in the challenging parkours of the underground empire. Climb walls, leap over platforms, and use your surroundings to evade enemies. Stay vigilant with every step\u2014each parkour will test your bravery.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034530/extras/runGif.gif?t=1749476231\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034530/extras/IngSecret.png?t=1749476231\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Solve challenging puzzles and uncover the mysteries hidden behind locked doors. Reveal the secrets of the past step by step and use your intellect to advance.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034530/extras/OpenGif.gif?t=1749476231\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034530/extras/QajeirZ_-_Imgur.png?t=1749476231\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><